{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_inmemorycache", "label": "InMemoryCache", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die Default-Cache-Implementierung: eine Map mit LRU-Eviction, fauler TTL pro Eintrag und optionalem Hintergrund-Sweep. In-Process, keine Abh\u00e4ngigkeiten, geht bei Neustart verloren."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_inmemorycacheoptions", "label": "InMemoryCacheOptions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Werte werden einmalig beim Konstruieren auf den gemergten Settings validiert \u2014 Builder, einfaches Objekt und HOCON treffen dieselbe Pr\u00fcfung."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_lru_eviction", "label": "LRU-Eviction bei maxEntries", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nur ein Read z\u00e4hlt als Nutzung: get, incr und mget schieben einen Key ans zuletzt-genutzte Ende, set, mset und setIfAbsent nicht \u2014 ein Eintrag, der geschrieben und nie zur\u00fcckgelesen wird, altert ab dem Moment der Speicherung auf die Eviction zu."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_lazy_ttl", "label": "Faule TTL plus Hintergrund-Sweep", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Sweep gewinnt abgelaufene Eintr\u00e4ge zur\u00fcck, die nie wieder angefasst werden; incr setzt die TTL nur, wenn es den Z\u00e4hler erzeugt \u2014 die richtige Semantik f\u00fcr einen Fixed-Window-Rate-Limiter."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_guarantee_bearing_entries", "label": "Garantie-tragende Eintr\u00e4ge", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein setIfAbsent-Claim oder ein incr-Z\u00e4hler mit endlicher TTL: f\u00fcr diese ist der Cache die Quelle der Wahrheit, einen davon zu verlieren kostet keinen Round-Trip, es entwertet die Garantie."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_opportunistic_entries", "label": "Opportunistische Eintr\u00e4ge", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Alles, was set/mset schreibt: dahinter steht eine Quelle der Wahrheit, ein Verlust ist also ein Cache-Miss, den der Aufrufer bereits behandelt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_eviction_ordering", "label": "Eviction leert zuerst die opportunistische H\u00e4lfte", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eine Flut eindeutiger Response-Cache-Keys kann damit kein gehaltenes Lock und keinen Rate-Limit-Z\u00e4hler mehr verdr\u00e4ngen. Ein set \u00fcbernimmt eine Garantie nur, wenn es einen lebenden Claim unter demselben Key ersetzt \u2014 sonst w\u00e4re jeder gecachte Response-Body gesch\u00fctzt und damit nichts."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_maxentries_hard_bound", "label": "maxEntries bleibt eine harte Schranke", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eine Garantie zu tragen ordnet die Opfer neu, verhindert nie eine Eviction: ein Cache, der nur Locks h\u00e4lt, evictet an der Schranke sein \u00e4ltestes. Ein Claim ohne TTL ist nicht gesch\u00fctzt, denn ihn zu sch\u00fctzen w\u00fcrde die Verklemmung dauerhaft machen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_cache_per_consumer", "label": "Ein Cache pro Consumer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die Politik ordnet Garantien nicht gegeneinander, also bleibt eine eigene benannte Instanz je Consumer die Empfehlung; das verkleinert den Explosionsradius, beseitigt ihn aber nicht, wo der Key-Raum eines Consumers angreiferkontrolliert ist."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_lost_guarantee_cost", "label": "Was eine verlorene Garantie kostet", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein verlorener Idempotency-Record f\u00fchrt den Handler ein zweites Mal aus \u2014 auf einem Payments-Endpoint eine Doppelbelastung; ein verlorenes Lock wird ein zweites Mal vergeben, und das release() des ersten Halters liefert false, was sich wie ein TTL-\u00dcberzug liest und hier das Gegenteil bedeutet."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_setifabsent_atomicity", "label": "setIfAbsent-Atomarit\u00e4t aus der Event-Loop", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lesen und Schreiben liegen im selben synchronen Block, und die single-threaded Event-Loop kann keinen anderen Aufrufer dazwischenschieben \u2014 das gilt aber nur innerhalb eines Prozesses."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_inmemorycache", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_inmemorycacheoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_inmemorycache", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_lru_eviction", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_inmemorycache", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_lazy_ttl", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_lru_eviction", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_eviction_ordering", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_eviction_ordering", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_guarantee_bearing_entries", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_eviction_ordering", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_opportunistic_entries", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_eviction_ordering", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_maxentries_hard_bound", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_maxentries_hard_bound", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_cache_per_consumer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_guarantee_bearing_entries", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_lost_guarantee_cost", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_inmemorycache", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_setifabsent_atomicity", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_inmemorycache", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_cache_interface", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_cache_per_consumer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_memcached_server_side_eviction", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_setifabsent_atomicity", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_overview_acquirelock", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_passivation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cache_in_memory_lru_eviction", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.65, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cache/in-memory.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": []}